1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,733
Songwriter: wiobr

2
00:00:00,733 --> 00:00:03,933
Turn it down…

3
00:00:06,366 --> 00:00:09,266
Feel it now…

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,933
No way out…

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:19,666
Midnight running through my veins

6
00:00:19,666 --> 00:00:23,400
Neon shadows say my name

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,700
Every silence cuts too loud

8
00:00:27,066 --> 00:00:30,666
Lost but never backing down

9
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:34,366
You say stay, I decay

10
00:00:34,566 --> 00:00:38,133
In the static we just fade

11
00:00:38,466 --> 00:00:42,100
Every heartbeat out of place

12
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,500
Dancing on a blade

13
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,566
Don’t save me now, I like the fall

14
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:58,933
No gravity when I lose it all

15
00:00:58,933 --> 00:01:02,466
Kill the glow, let it die

16
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:05,566
Burn the stars out of my sky

17
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:09,866
Feel the dark come alive

18
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:13,766
I don’t need the light

19
00:01:14,066 --> 00:01:17,600
Cut the wires, lose control

20
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:21,400
Feed the fire in my soul

21
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:25,133
If I break, let me go

22
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:28,333
I was never whole

23
00:01:30,766 --> 00:01:34,533
Cracked reflections in the glass

24
00:01:34,533 --> 00:01:37,966
Future bleeding from the past

25
00:01:38,466 --> 00:01:41,866
Every truth just slips away

26
00:01:42,066 --> 00:01:44,600
Nothing left to say

27
00:01:45,766 --> 00:01:49,566
Cold ignition, blacked-out dreams

28
00:01:49,566 --> 00:01:53,333
Nothing’s ever what it seems

29
00:01:53,333 --> 00:01:56,733
If I’m fading, let me be

30
00:01:56,966 --> 00:01:59,466
Set the chaos free

31
00:01:59,466 --> 00:02:06,900
Don’t save me now, I like the fall

32
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:13,900
No gravity when I lose it all

33
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:17,500
Kill the glow, let it die

34
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:21,333
Burn the stars out of my sky

35
00:02:21,333 --> 00:02:24,866
Feel the dark come alive

36
00:02:25,166 --> 00:02:28,466
I don’t need the light

37
00:02:29,066 --> 00:02:32,700
Cut the wires, lose control

38
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:36,466
Feed the fire in my soul

39
00:02:36,466 --> 00:02:39,966
If I break, let me go

40
00:02:40,266 --> 00:02:43,300
I was never whole

41
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:48,400
Lights flicker, heartbeat gone

42
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:51,966
Right or wrong, I move on

43
00:02:51,966 --> 00:02:54,800
No more halos, no disguise

44
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,966
Only shadows in my eyes

45
00:03:13,933 --> 00:03:14,866
Kill it

46
00:03:28,933 --> 00:03:30,600
Turn it off…

47
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,100
Fade to black…

48
00:03:44,066 --> 00:03:45,500
No way back…